  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 6: PROS AND CONS
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="pros-and-cons" class="content-section reveal" aria-label="Pros and Cons of DST">
    <h2>6. The Pros and Cons of DST</h2>
    <p>
      The seasonal clock change remains a highly controversial policy. Proponents and critics point to distinct social and physiological impacts:
    </p>

    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table aria-label="Pros and Cons of DST">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Advantages (Pros)</th>
            <th>Disadvantages (Cons)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Evening Recreation</strong>: Lighter evenings encourage outdoor exercise, family outings, and sports participation.</td>
            <td><strong>Sleep Disruption</strong>: Shifting the clock by one hour disrupts biological clocks (circadian rhythms), causing temporary fatigue.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Economic Boost</strong>: Retail stores, golf courses, and restaurants report higher sales due to increased evening foot traffic.</td>
            <td><strong>Cardiovascular Risks</strong>: Studies document a 24% spike in heart attacks on the Monday following the spring transition.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Pedestrian Safety</strong>: Extra daylight in the evening reduces pedestrian vehicle accidents during rush hours.</td>
            <td><strong>Accident Spikes</strong>: Loss of sleep in the spring leads to a short-term increase in workplace accidents and fatal car crashes.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

